---
# AMA Cryptography C code style
#
# SCOPE — read before running this over anything.
#
# This file is a style REFERENCE for new and edited C, not a formatter you can
# run across the tree.  The existing sources are hand-formatted (aligned
# continuation lines, aligned comment blocks, and a mix of `void* p` and
# `void *p` that no single PointerAlignment setting reproduces), so a
# whole-tree `clang-format -i` rewrites 9,571 lines across 31 files.  Measured
# on 2026-08-17 with clang-format 18; `PointerAlignment: Left` was worse
# (10,316).  Nothing in CI runs clang-format, and nothing should start doing
# so without that reformat being a deliberate, separate change.
#
# Language: Cpp — NOT `C`.
#
# `Language: C` was rejected outright by every clang-format before LLVM 20,
# including the clang-18 this project pins in CI and ships in its container
# images: `unknown enumerated scalar` → `Error reading .clang-format: Invalid
# argument`.  The file could not be loaded at all, which meant the command
# this comment used to advertise errored out, and an editor with format-on-save
# silently fell back to LLVM defaults (2-space indent, 80 columns) — the
# opposite of what this file exists to specify.  `Cpp` is the language kind
# clang-format has always used for C sources and is valid in every version,
# including 20+.
Language: Cpp
BasedOnStyle: LLVM

# Indentation
IndentWidth: 4
TabWidth: 4
UseTab: Never
IndentCaseLabels: false

# Braces
BreakBeforeBraces: Attach
AllowShortBlocksOnASingleLine: Empty
AllowShortFunctionsOnASingleLine: Empty
AllowShortIfStatementsOnASingleLine: Never
AllowShortLoopsOnASingleLine: false

# Line length
ColumnLimit: 100

# Alignment
AlignAfterOpenBracket: Align
AlignConsecutiveAssignments: false
AlignConsecutiveDeclarations: false
AlignOperands: Align
AlignTrailingComments: true

# Spacing
SpaceAfterCStyleCast: false
SpaceBeforeParens: ControlStatements
SpacesInParentheses: false

# Includes
SortIncludes: false  # Preserve include order (security-sensitive)

# Pointer alignment
PointerAlignment: Right

# Comments
ReflowComments: true
SpacesBeforeTrailingComments: 2
...
